@startuml
title Dromos - Sequential route batching (up to 100 destinations)
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Validate start, ordered destinations and options;
:Geocode addresses through CachedGeocoder;
:Build point list in the user's exact order;

if (Return to start?) then (yes)
  :Append the start point to the end;
endif

:Initialize aggregated distance, duration,\nlegs, provider responses and polylines;

while (At least two unprocessed points remain?) is (yes)
  :Take at most 12 points\n(origin + 10 intermediates + destination);
  :Request an in-order economy route;
  note right
    No waypoint optimization.
    No live-traffic routing.
    Toll avoidance is forwarded when enabled.
  end note
  :Append section legs, totals, response and polyline;
  :Advance to the section destination;
  note right
    The previous destination becomes the next
    origin, so adjacent sections overlap by one point.
  end note
endwhile (no)

:Store one route_plan, all stops, aggregate totals,\nand multiple encoded polylines;
:Render the complete route as connected road sections;
stop
@enduml

